WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.157
Blue, offset to f. Yellow, state direction.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.661
They span a plane.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.357
The pink message stays in it.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.438
Edge on, the plane becomes a line.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.758
Two more neighbours, each with a plane.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.099
Added tip to tail, the total sticks out of every plane.
